>> Animal := Ikintu gishya.
Animal bigeze: ['sound:'] kora: { :s icyacyo sound := s. }.
Animal bigeze: ['makeSound'] kora: { Ibisohoka andika: icyacyo sound. }.
>> Cat := Animal gishya.
Cat bigeze: ['init'] kora: { icyacyo sound := ['MEOW!'].}.
Cat bigeze: ['meow'] kora: { ubwacyo makeSound. }.
Cat init.
Cat meow.
